<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px 0;">
    <div style="background-color: #FEE2E2; border-radius: 50%; width: 60px; height: 60px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 30px;">&#128337;</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #DC2626; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Extended Maintenance Notice
  </h2>

  <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
    Hi {{userName}},
  </p>

  <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
    We need to inform you that the maintenance period for <strong>{{serviceName}}</strong> has been extended.
  </p>

  <div style="background-color: #F3F4F6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px;">
        <p style="color: #6B7280; margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;">
          Previous Estimate
        </p>
        <p style="color: #9CA3AF; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: line-through;">
          {{previousCountdownEnd}}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 15px;">
      <p style="color: #6B7280; margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        New Expected Availability
      </p>
      <p style="color: #1F2937; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
        {{newCountdownEnd}}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #FEE2E2; border-left: 4px solid #EF4444; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
    <p style="color: #991B1B; margin: 0;">
      We sincerely apologize for this delay. Our team is working hard to resolve the issues and restore the service as soon as possible.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
    We understand this may cause inconvenience, and we truly appreciate your patience. We'll notify you immediately once the service is back online.
  </p>

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px;">
    <p style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
      Thank you for your continued support.
    </p>
    <p style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
      - The CosmicForge HealthNet Team
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
